.git
docs
**/*_test.go
**/testdata

# Pod runtime output. file-drop writes its SFTP tree and its generated
# host/PGP keys to <recipe>/pod-data/, so running the tests leaves private
# keys inside the build context. .gitignore hides them from `git status`,
# which is exactly why this file has to exclude them too: without it,
# `COPY recipes /recipes` bakes one machine's keys into every image, and
# the copied root-owned tree leaves the pod user unable to write uploads.
**/pod-data
